Adds 256-bit primes (secq256r1) to circom-witnesscalc so the zkID OpenAC circuits
(jwt_2k, show) can be evaluated from a witness graph without the GPL-3.0 C++ witnesscalc.
Base: https://github.com/iden3/circom-witnesscalc commit d48eb7c97857d46b8a75c94ab96f769207263245 (MIT).
This patch is distributed under the same MIT license as the code it modifies.
Apply with: git -C <circom-witnesscalc> apply <this file>

